<title>USA: Dixie Yarns Inc Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Dixie Yarns Inc Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.18     loss	 $0.53</p>
<p> Net     profit	   2,030     loss	 6,030</p>
<p> Sales		    145,400		  161,289</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,206		   11,293</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.21     loss	 $0.40</p>
<p> Net     profit	   2,359     loss	 4,716</p>
<p> Sales		    474,882		  520,744</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,204		   11,927</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1995 results include an after-tax loss of $3.8 million or $0.33 per share from the sale of a manufacturing facility, net of casualty insurance gains.</p>
</text>
